## A correction made during this work
The provider/blocked-rate figures reported EARLIER in this session counted
`code='nova_validation'`, which also carries an unrelated 55-second idle-stream
timeout, and did not filter by `origin` (so staging benchmark traffic from this
same session was mixed into "production"). Both are corrected here. The earlier
"35.8% -> 66.7%" framing should not be used.

